and reopen as a worker co-op this would be funded by a national bank to loan workers the money a similar bank could presumably be open to fund apartment building purchases by tenants vacancy taxes so if apartment or condo is vacant you have to pay an extra tax on it if an apartment or condo is the pita terror is otherwise usually unoccupied

